BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 745.0 Tm (40. A patient with coronary atheroma is comfortable at rest but develops exertional chest pain. Which) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.7 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 731.3 Tm (explanation fits best?) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.3 Tf 0.1 0.33 0.58 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 714.6 Tm (Answer: B. Restricted coronary flow reserve cannot meet increased demand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.16 0.18 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 48.0 698.3 Tm (Explanation: A narrowed vessel may deliver adequate resting flow but cannot dilate enough to meet exercise demand,) Tj ET
